183-    if v is not None:\n184-        return v\n185-    v, _tier = meta.answer(answer_id, question, data)\n186-    return v\n187-\n188-\n189-def _past_deadline():\n190-    \"\"\"The timed runner's HCTF_SOLVE_DEADLINE (epoch) has passed: print the answers found so far instead.\"\"\"\n191-    try:\n192-        return time.time() > float(os.environ[\"HCTF_SOLVE_DEADLINE\"])\n193-    except (KeyError, ValueError):\n194-        return False\n195-\n196-\n197-def _solve_pairs(job):\n198-    \"\"\"Answer one group of (answer_id, question) pairs -- a whole Mastery set, or the whole contract.\"\"\"\n199-    root, contract, pairs = job\n200-    global _ROOT\n201-    _ROOT = root\n5:minor version u32 @24 (3 NT4..XP, 5 Vista+), file type u32 @28, file format u32 @32, root cell offset u32 @36\n8:Root key = the nk cell at 0x1000 + root cell offset (cell-relative): i32 size, \"nk\" @4, flags u16 @6 (0x20 COMP_NAME = name\n13:Not \"regf\" (e.g. a Win9x \"CREG\" hive renamed .dat) -> \"none\"; regf with an unreadable root cell -> None.\n16:  subkey_count / value_count / last_written_utc: of the key named in the question (a backslash path, root-relative,\n17:  case-insensitive; a leading root/HKCU/HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE prefix is dropped), else of the ROOT key. last_written_utc\n18:  is the key node's FILETIME (the target spec says \"root key last-written\"; the base-block time stays\n21:  SOFTWARE hive: at the root), stored value-list order; REG_SZ/EXPAND_SZ = UTF-16LE up to the first NUL,\n30:FIELDS = {\n57:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_name\"): \"root_value\",\n58:    (\"regf\", \"root_nk_name\"): \"root_value\",\n59:    (\"regf\", \"root_cell_key_name\"): \"root_value\",\n60:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_last_written_time\"): \"root_value\",\n61:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_subkey_count\"): \"root_value\",\n62:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_number_of_subkeys\"): \"root_value\",\n63:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_value_count\"): \"root_value\",\n64:    (\"regf\", \"root_key_number_of_values\"): \"root_value