no longer comes up. I also rejected the older script and binary lane notes (lazy regex compiling, parallel AES unzip, `gm_error_body`): they're speed or harness refactors, not GM-confirmed facts, and day 25 didn't need them.\n5. **Not changed:** the three day-25 web handlers (`lib/web/handlers/day25_*.py`) were already in place; I checked that they load and register, but couldn't test them against live targets offline. Script analysis, binary and mobile passed every mode first try with no new codec or field, so nothing from them went into lib."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":95357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":372},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89fe87c2-cca2-45f8-808b-9fa2537ce9b4","uuid":"d74e38fb-29a8-4df9-8376-fabfa1d8dfc2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:10:38.587Z","request_id":"req_011CgP1aB2r3SLe4xC9bYULd"}
